<title>USA: Roadhouse Grill president/CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Roadhouse Grill president/CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roadhouse Grill Inc said on Tuesday J. David Toole III resigned as president and chief executive to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The restaurant company said its board retained an executive search firm to find a successor.</p>
<p>Toole said:  &quot;The company has reached a size where it makes sense to bring in a seasoned industry veteran to take the company to the next level.&quot;</p>
<p>Until a new president is named, Brad Haber, vice president of operations, and Dennis Jones, chief financial officer, would report directly to the board, it said.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
